    "created_at": "2017-11-22T17:44:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-11-22T17:44:15Z",
    "body": "It is clear I think. The empty byte sequence is neither a match for a JavaScript MIME type or `text/css`. There's no reference to \"valid MIME type\" in the Fetch Standard so I'm not sure what you mean by that.",
