    "created_at": "2017-11-23T06:36:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-11-23T06:36:25Z",
    "body": "File name is never consulted over HTTP. What makes you think it is? And yeah, for XCTO to work you always need a Content-Type header for script and style sheets. This follows directly from the algorithms in the specification.",
