    "updated_at": "2017-11-23T08:27:06Z",
    "body": "No, extensions are never used over the network. There's no standard that says they should be used either. Sniffing is defined in https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/ and only used when invoked. It's not invoked here.\r\n\r\nI still don't think there's any ambiguity here.",
